    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/3e09067429a50a19b82372558a50ac41.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/e8496919ad43335930e70591ad089e07.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter various PCs, each one with its own Operative System and unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/dab81a89fd60935dac82353b4753141b.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run from pesky anti-viruses and avoid all the hazards that each computer might hide! Jump between folders, sensitive information and hardware parts to traverse the world of Malware City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/7035acf60724146e56d62d9df7f42576.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every PC has its parts, and each part can be infected and destroyed! But be careful, every component behaves differently and has his own and unique protection system. Will you be able to destroy them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/c08383ef358c59f17e5b219a80193743.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some PCs may have hidden minigames inside them, collect them all and replay these classic gems freely in the Arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/b0e950ca81cdf879b16531b936befe3e.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surf the most dangerous tides of the internet. Dodge deadly traps and other viruses, work your way back to your origins and face your creator!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/3e09067429a50a19b82372558a50ac41.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/557d820c11ce23bc9d63b460bb95b15e.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/e8496919ad43335930e70591ad089e07.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/27b24e46e1c7127994b524b44219b246.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter various PCs, each one with its own Operative System and unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/dab81a89fd60935dac82353b4753141b.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/a0a8fc6f2ae8cdeb3042966ae21d17b4.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run from pesky anti-viruses and avoid all the hazards that each computer might hide! Jump between folders, sensitive information and hardware parts to traverse the world of Malware City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/7035acf60724146e56d62d9df7f42576.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/6efcde85b7d5985678bb1fa74733c05d.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every PC has its parts, and each part can be infected and destroyed! But be careful, every component behaves differently and has his own and unique protection system. Will you be able to destroy them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/c08383ef358c59f17e5b219a80193743.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/24c8e31bd47de4b361cc6115e7c2adc2.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some PCs may have hidden minigames inside them, collect them all and replay these classic gems freely in the Arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/b0e950ca81cdf879b16531b936befe3e.webp?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.poster.avif?t=1748984541\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.webm?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/96125b07c8b181d30c453b276700c511.mp4?t=1748984541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surf the most dangerous tides of the internet. Dodge deadly traps and other viruses, work your way back to your origins and face your creator!</p>",
